choice REHAB_DECISION_THINKING_MODE
    prompt "Formal rehab decision DeepSeek thinking mode"
    default REHAB_DECISION_THINKING_ENABLED_HIGH
    help
        Applies only to the Local UI / Root formal rehab decision request.
        It does not change memory extraction or other agent requests.

    config REHAB_DECISION_THINKING_ENABLED_HIGH
        bool "Thinking enabled, explicit high effort"
        help
            Explicitly enables thinking and pins DeepSeek reasoning effort to
            high. This is the conservative default and avoids an automatic
            promotion to max where the provider would otherwise apply one.

    config REHAB_DECISION_THINKING_DISABLED
        bool "Thinking disabled"
        help
            Explicitly selects DeepSeek non-thinking mode for formal rehab
            decision A/B testing. Validate quality and tool-call reliability
            before retaining this selection.
endchoice
